    <string name="i_agree">I agree to the License Agreement</string>
    <string name="content_license_agreement">IPTV supports M3U and JSON playlists created by users. We do not provide or host any content.\n\nThis app is intended only for legally obtained content. You are responsible for ensuring your playlists and content comply with applicable laws and permissions.\n\nBy continuing, you confirm that you understand and accept these terms.\n\nDisclaimer\n\nIPTV does not provide or promote any content and is not affiliated with third-party providers.\n\nUsers must supply their own content. Unauthorized streaming of copyrighted material is strongly discouraged.</string>
    <string name="content_1">You can search online with keywords like “IPTV M3U playlist” or check guidance provided by your TV/streaming service.\nA proper M3U link typically:\n• Begins with http:// or https://\n• Ends with .m3u or .m3u8\nTry to use trusted and legal sources whenever possible. Note that some playlists may expire, require login credentials, or be limited by region.</string>
    <string name="content_2">To copy the M3U URL:\n• On mobile: Tap and hold the link → select Copy link\n• On desktop: Right-click the link → choose Copy link address\nTo download the playlist file:\n• Save the .m3u or .m3u8 file to an easy-to-access location on your device\nYou can later import the file directly from your local storage (refer to Step 3).</string>
    <string name="content_3">Launch IPTV Smart Player.\nSelect Add Playlist.\nPick one method to import:\n• Via URL → Paste your M3U link\n• From File → Browse and choose the saved .m3u / .m3u8 file on your device\n(Optional) Enter a custom name to easily identify your playlist later\nTap Save to finish.</string>
    <string name="content_4">Give the app a moment to load channels and categories.\nExplore the channel list or use the Search feature to quickly find what you want.\nIf no content shows up:\n• Check your internet connection\n• Ensure the M3U link or file is still valid and working</string>
    <string name="an_internet_connection_is_required_to_continue_using_the_app_please_check_your_network_settings_and_reconnect">An internet connection is required to continue using the app.\nPlease check your network settings and reconnect.</string>
